NUGET PACKAGES

The web application (InstaGrabber) declares no PackageReference and therefore
redistributes no NuGet packages.

The test project (InstaGrabber.Tests) is not packaged or shipped
(IsPackable=false). Its dependencies are build- and test-time only:

  Microsoft.NET.Test.Sdk 18.8.1     — MIT, (c) .NET Foundation and Contributors
  xunit 2.9.3                       — Apache-2.0, (c) .NET Foundation and Contributors
  xunit.runner.visualstudio 2.8.2   — Apache-2.0, (c) .NET Foundation and Contributors
  coverlet.collector 6.0.0          — MIT, (c) Toni Solarin-Sodara

These four resolve to 16 packages transitively. No machine-readable SBOM ships
with 0.0.1; see CHANGELOG.md under "Known issues".
